1
00:00:00,652 --> 00:00:02,822
(Leonard:)That's the definition
of being a know-it-all.

2
00:00:02,821 --> 00:00:06,361
Or in German, a Besserwisser.

3
00:00:09,161 --> 00:00:11,491
(Penny:)How did you think you were
gonna hide your pregnancy?

4
00:00:11,496 --> 00:00:14,096
(Bernadette:)I had a plan-- I kept leaving
Dove Bar wrappers around

5
00:00:14,099 --> 00:00:16,329
(Bernadette:)to explain any weight gain.

6
00:00:17,569 --> 00:00:20,099
(Amy:)Where did you get
empty Dove Bar wrappers?

7
00:00:20,105 --> 00:00:22,775
(Bernadette:)From all the Dove Bars
I ate! I'm pregnant!

8
00:00:22,774 --> 00:00:24,804
Try to keep up!

9
00:00:26,378 --> 00:00:28,478
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry.
I-I have to go find out

10
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:29,790
(Bernadette:)if my boss knows.

11
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,950
(Amy:)Well, whatever happens,
we're here for you.

12
00:00:31,954 --> 00:00:33,144
(Bernadette:)Thanks.
You guys are the best.

13
00:00:33,145 --> 00:00:34,955
(Penny:)Yeah, drive safe. We love you.
And give us a call...

14
00:00:34,953 --> 00:00:36,253
(Penny:)Oh, my God,
it was me, it was me!

15
00:00:36,254 --> 00:00:37,524
(Penny:)I'm the one who blabbed
she was pregnant!

16
00:00:37,522 --> 00:00:38,632
What?!

17
00:00:38,653 --> 00:00:39,393
(Penny:)I didn't mean to.
It just slipped out

18
00:00:39,391 --> 00:00:41,211
(Penny:)in front of her assistant
one day. I...

19
00:00:41,236 --> 00:00:41,996
(Bernadette:)I forgot my coat.

20
00:00:41,993 --> 00:00:43,893
Oh! Here's your coat, honey.

21
00:00:43,895 --> 00:00:45,895
(Penny:)That's such a cute jacket.

22
00:00:45,897 --> 00:00:47,267
(Sheldon:)Oh...

23
00:00:47,265 --> 00:00:49,165
(Penny:)God, I feel so bad--
I just lied to her.

24
00:00:49,167 --> 00:00:51,097
(Amy:)Oh, but you did it so well.

25
00:00:51,102 --> 00:00:52,872
That's amazing!

26
00:00:54,005 --> 00:00:55,535
(Amy:)It's like watching a sculptor,

27
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:58,040
(Amy:)but your clay was lies.

28
00:00:58,043 --> 00:01:00,243
(Penny:)Is that really
what's important right now?

